    "background_story": "Gustavo was a seasoned sailor who had spent his entire life at sea. After decades of traveling the world, he decided it was time to disembark from his beloved ship, the 'Maverick's Revenge'. As he stepped onto dry land, Gustavo felt a mix of emotions: excitement for the new chapter ahead, but also a sense of loss for the life he was leaving behind. He had seen it all - from raging storms to tranquil sunsets - and had made friends with people from all walks of life. Gustavo settled in a small coastal town, where he opened a quaint sailor's tavern, regaling patrons with tales of his adventures. Though he never forgot the thrill of the open sea, Gustavo was content to have finally found a place to call home, and to share his stories with those who would listen.",
